# The "Only my voice" speaker model is NOT committed (cloud-builds step 4, 2026-11-20).
# A cloud build (.github/scripts/fetch_speaker_model.sh --install) takes ONE of two files:
#
#   release_ok=yes  the OFFICIAL file from `url`, checked by `bytes` and `sha256`. In force since the
#                   owner's phone test on 2026-11-20 (new voiceprint, his wakes accepted and other
#                   voices rejected; the scores stay off the repo). Laptop and cloud builds both take it.
#   release_ok=no   INTERIM: the copy that ships on the phone today (one byte shorter than the
#                   official file, another sha256, origin unproven), from the owner's private APK
#                   bucket at `interim_object` (keyless Google sign-in, production environment only),
#                   checked by `interim_bytes` and `interim_sha256`. Never committed.
#
# Either way a cloud APK never builds without a speaker model: a missing or mismatched file stops the
# build. The interim lines stay as the documented way back (release_ok=no needs the bucket login).
#
# Official source: k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx release "speaker-recongition-models" (sic), the ONNX export of
# 3D-Speaker's ERes2Net (English, VoxCeleb, 16 kHz). bytes and sha256 are the ones GitHub reports for
# that release asset (asset digest, read 2026-11-20; the asset was last updated 2026-11-19), and a CI
# fetch matched them (speaker-model.yml). Licence: Apache-2.0 (modelscope/3D-Speaker and
# k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx); notice in app/src/main/assets/speaker/README.md. The licence text is fetched from
# 3D-Speaker at a pinned commit and checked by its git blob id (the standard Apache-2.0 text).
path=speaker/3dspeaker_speech_eres2net_sv_en_voxceleb_16k.onnx
url=https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/download/speaker-recongition-models/3dspeaker_speech_eres2net_sv_en_voxceleb_16k.onnx
bytes=26485264
sha256=c4947caf150b8502fdd75bbe4089b971ab1ec42e90ee3ba547faca2cde44d9ee
license_path=licenses/3dspeaker-eres2net-Apache-2.0.txt
license_url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/modelscope/3D-Speaker/b6ea24f428a178c02b7ef9d6900569050448c8a1/LICENSE
license_git_blob=261eeb9e9f8b2b4b0d119366dda99c6fd7d35c64
interim_object=build-assets/speaker/3dspeaker_speech_eres2net_sv_en_voxceleb_16k.onnx
interim_bytes=26485263
interim_sha256=c59158379255ad66e161679cca6af8d52d51e389e3224ab7d7a7baae295c2db5
release_ok=yes
